{"id":"comme","lemma":"comme","pos":"conj","rank":46,"glosses":["as (in the role of, by way of)","like, as","such as"],"ipa":"/kɔm/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/7/7c/Fr-comme.ogg/Fr-comme.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Fais comme il te dit.","en":"Do as he tells you.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/69453","words":[{"g":"to do","l":"faire"},null,{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to say, to tell","l":"dire"}]},{"text":"Viens comme tu es.","en":"Come as you are.","words":[{"g":"to come","l":"venir"},null,{"g":"you"},{"g":"are","l":"être"}]},{"text":"Tu dois faire comme je dis.","en":"You must do as I say.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"must","l":"devoir"},{"g":"to do"},null,{"g":"I"},{"g":"to say, to tell","l":"dire"}]},{"text":"Il est comme mort.","en":"He is as good as dead.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},null,{"g":"dead"}]},{"text":"Voudrais-tu vivre comme ça ?","en":"Would you want to live like that?","words":[{"g":"to want, wish, desire","l":"vouloir"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to live"},null,{"g":"that"}]}]}